WEBVTT

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.750
This is just a story,

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:18.000
a silly fairy tale...

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.070
In a town, where everything
had been destroyed,

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:24.460
there was a young man.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:27.500
The young man had nothing...

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.550
Nothing to protect.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:31.530
Nowhere to go home to.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.880
It was all buried beneath the rubble.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:40.590
The young man saw a child,
trapped under a fallen building.

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:44.290
He clicked his tongue and swore to himself,

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:46.560
but he moved the rubble aside.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.060
When he was done,

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.860
he was covered with scrapes,
and his nails were chipped.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.360
But he didn't care.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:59.400
However, once the child was saved,

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.960
he saw that child's mother,
trapped in a well.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.620
He clicked his tongue and swore to himself,

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:09.610
but once again, he moved the rubble aside.

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:12.890
With his nails too broken to continue,

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:17.130
he took a fork this time,
and kept digging at the ground.

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:20.960
When he saved one, another appeared.

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:24.270
He clicked his tongue and swore to himself,

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:27.000
but he kept moving the rubble aside,

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:32.850
as he, covered in dust,
whipped his tired body on.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:37.150
The young man had nothing,

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:41.240
and there was no reason for him to do all this.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:45.740
But he could hear them...

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.330
The moans from beneath the rubble.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:54.050
The cries of lost children seeking their parents.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:57.720
These clung to his ears and never faded.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:01.040
He clicked his tongue and swore to himself,

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:07.230
and as he kept digging,
the people saw a hero in him.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:10.810
When man ascends from the pit of despair,

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.960
he becomes a hero.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:19.800
He can fight, tightly clutching
a bent fork in his hand.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.880
This is just a story,

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:27.300
a silly fairy tale...

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:33.790
But now, there is a young man here.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:37.030
A young man, having lost the girl
with whom he'd shared his heart,

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:40.230
is torn apart by the sadness
of being unable to protect

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.700
his beloved.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.970
Even so, he fights.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:49.950
Yes, he is a hero.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:56.990
Even a bent fork may become
a demon-slaying sword.

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:14.600
Arkham City is functioning at 43%.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.690
Local police are handling citizen evacuation

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.600
to the shelters.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.340
And the Dream Heart Mother?

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:28.050
It continues its eerie silence above the city.

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:30.650
I see.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:35.590
Demonbane's maintenance is
scheduled to finish soon.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.660
E-Enemy attack!

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:45.160
Someone, most likely the Black Lodge,
has infiltrated the base!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.690
It's one...

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:48.900
Just one person!

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:58.680
Now... I've come to your home.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.900
I'm going to avenge Caligula.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:07.480
Counterattack system down, at points J and K.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:08.690
They've been penetrated.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:12.420
The enemy continues heading
for the base core.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:16.710
Security teams are to carry ES-type equipment

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.930
and to head for gate A-26,
to engage the intruder.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.130
Gate A-26 penetrated.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.830
Point L has gone totally silent.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.380
What speed!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.210
The intruder has stopped at point N!

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.720
What happened?

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.490
I don't know.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.380
But we've detected a

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.520
magical energy signal at point N
that isn't the intruder's.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:47.730
This energy... Could it be...

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:53.740
So you're here.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:57.000
I've been waiting, Kuro Daijuji.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:01.370
I'm sure you know this,
but I'm killing you for Caligula.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.880
Don't expect to die too easily.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.140
Don't get cocky, kid.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.980
That's insane...

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:14.000
Sonya, issue a withdrawal order
to Mr. Daijuji immediately!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.020
Let's believe in him.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.590
Winfield!

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:22.200
We have our own tasks.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.700
I'll riddle you with holes!

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.020
Hey, that's kind of lame,

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.590
Kuro...

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:48.860
Is that it?

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:53.570
"I can't do anything without my Al!"

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.150
Stay down.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:02.530
I'll send you to see your Al Azif right now!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.110
A mechanical doll?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:12.460
I see. So you switched sides to Hado, huh?

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:14.850
Elsa is always on her darling's side-robo.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.180
You're in the way!

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.680
Hey, your back is wide-open!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.680
Are you an idiot?

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:21.120
You're the idiot.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.190
What?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.490
<i>Evocation Magic: Dig Me No Grave!</i>

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:27.190
Hang on...

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.190
Fire!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.980
Are you okay-robo?

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.320
Darling!

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:39.700
You saved me, Elsa.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.750
Checkmate.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:51.720
I won't show you pity, just
because you're a kid.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.050
Thanks to you, Al...

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.220
Al...

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:56.720
It's over!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.960
Crap!

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.520
Damn it!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.100
No, you don't!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:20.510
Anticross has left block 6, advancing north.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.510
He's destroying the firewalls,
one after another.

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:26.880
Anticross has changed course.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:30.120
That leads to gate 13.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.660
Demonbane's hanger!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.660
Makoto! Sonya!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.630
Hurry and seal the gate!

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:45.040
Darling, he's after Demonbane,
while it's being repaired-robo.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.170
So that's it?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.440
I won't allow it!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.140
Darling, let's floor it-robo!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:57.580
Anticross has reached the final gate
before the repair hangar.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.620
This is bad!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.620
The firewalls aren't holding.

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:02.630
He's breaking through.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:25.140
Hey, there! You big piece of rusted trash!

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:27.880
Anticross has entered the hanger!

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.510
<i>Mr. Daijuji...</i>

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:36.540
You're late, Kuro!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.260
I've been waiting for you.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.330
Be thankful.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.570
Why, you...

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:46.960
Sit back and watch, you bastard!

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:58.140
Stop it!

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.140
Stop!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.450
Let's play!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:15.730
How did you like my performance?

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.320
Awesome!

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:22.280
Commander, message from the hanger.

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:25.530
They've successfully defeated
the Anticross infiltrator.

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:28.240
I-I see...

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:31.410
We did it! We did it! We did it!

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.550
Winfield.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:40.820
What?

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:46.180
Warrior Winfield...

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:49.060
I've come to complete my battle with you.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:53.360
Mistress, please retreat to a safe distance.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.160
Winfield...

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.950
My opponent has requested me specifically.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:00.670
Etiquette dictates that I respond.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:04.330
I thank you, warrior Winfield.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.180
Here I go!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.890
Hey, what's going on?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:08.810
What happened?

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.710
Is something wrong?

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:13.640
There's something wrong at
the command center...

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:14.850
It can't be—

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:19.560
Who said I came alone?

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.290
Don't forget...

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.200
You fight me.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.440
<i>Iya! Iya! Hastur!</i>

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.290
Lord Byakhee!

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:46.080
A-A Deus Machina?

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:57.630
Mr. Daijuji, we're booting up
Demonbane immediately.

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:01.230
Winfield is dealing with the
Anticross member here.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:05.070
You just focus on defeating the Deus Machina.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.440
Winfield?

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.340
Hurry and boot up Demonbane!

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.670
Understood!

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.340
Hurry!

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:50.850
If no one's inside it, this thing's
just a big pile of metal.

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:54.350
I'll rip it apart with Lord Byakhee.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:58.860
You can't even get inside,
let alone boot that up!

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.820
That's not true!

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.310
What?

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.060
Kuro, now's your chance!

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.320
Right.

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.070
Elsa!

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.390
Roger-robo.

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:39.330
Booting up Demonbane!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.380
But...

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.170
All magical devices,
functioning at 30% normal capacity!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.050
It's no good.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.230
I can't raise their output any further!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:54.040
I believe the reason is damage to the base,
caused by Anticross.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.440
Route all spare power in the base,

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.320
except at this location and the
evacuation shelters, to Demonbane!

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.510
Mistress!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.990
Your highest priority is starting up Demonbane!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.460
What's wrong?

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:14.010
Still asleep?

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.450
You're annoying me.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:21.610
None of you small-fry can touch me!

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.090
It's no good-robo.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.470
We can't stand up-robo!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:34.700
Azathoth, full charge in twenty-six seconds.

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.960
Twenty seconds.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:43.260
If you're not going to wake up,
then I'll just tear you apart.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.280
It's no good-robo!

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.790
Don't give up!

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.100
Believe in the princess!

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.990
This is it!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.910
What?

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:07.120
This... This is our Demonbane!

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:12.890
Demonbane, fully booted up!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.490
We did it!

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:16.240
Mistress!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:16.990
Evacuate!

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:19.000
Don't look aside during combat.

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:20.830
You're mine!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.330
Winfield!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.470
What?

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:36.410
<i>Special Move: Fortissimo.</i>

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.390
I'll smash you into the ground.

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:48.890
Shut your mouth!

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:49.920
<i>Timaeus!</i>

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:50.830
<i>Critias!</i>

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.820
Activate!

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.230
Damn you...

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:02.370
Here's where it gets real, brat!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:06.380
You're still going to fight?

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.910
Of course.

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:11.380
Interesting... Interesting, indeed.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.810
This is how it should be.

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:17.850
Or there was no point in my coming.

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:22.860
Your life is mine!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.370
You're mine!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.050
No!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:50.120
I'll tear you apart at top speed!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:53.290
<i>Screaming Bird!</i>

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:02.200
Darling, what do we do?

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.670
Lemuria Impact.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:10.510
We'll match his charge with a Lemuria Impact!

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:13.330
That's crazy, darling-robo.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:16.420
Princess, send us the Naacal Code.

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:22.520
Princess? Princess?

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:23.490
What's wrong?

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.270
Princess!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.070
Darling, the next attack is coming-robo.

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:26.840
What?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:36.530
I guess you can't do anything without Al Azif...

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:40.370
So don't resist. Just die!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.770
You know how that goes, right?

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:50.500
You cannot throw everything away,

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.670
but I've thrown it all away for power.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:57.890
In the end, that difference decided our fates.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:04.040
Winfield...

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:08.900
Win... Winfield!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:11.400
Winfield, open your eyes!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.910
Winfield, please open your eyes!

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:19.250
Commander, Demonbane is
requesting Lemuria Impact...

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.320
No!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.650
Winfield! Winfield!

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:24.380
Mistress Ruri.

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.820
No... No!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.890
Mistress Ruri.

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:33.760
Winfield?

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:39.010
Have you forgotten what it is you must do?

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:51.940
Demonbane... Mr. Daijuji is waiting for you.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.680
Please stand, Commander.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:59.180
Do what you must.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:01.220
Winfield...

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:06.190
Give me support!

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:07.420
Understood!

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:12.160
Lemuria Impact activation approved!

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:16.770
<i>You are the purifying flame of Betelgeuse!</i>

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:20.240
<i>The right hand of the giant, unleashed.</i>

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:22.540
<i>The sword of perfect victory!</i>

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.100
Transmitting Naacal Code!

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:26.790
Darling!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.140
Okay!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.290
I'll show you, Claudius,

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:33.180
our Demonbane's power!

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:38.030
This is for Caligula...

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.660
I'll tear you to pieces!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:48.800
You're the one who'll end up in pieces!

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:55.640
<i>Lemuria Impact!</i>

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:03.480
<i>Caligula!</i>

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:30.570
We did it!

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:32.450
We did it.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.920
We did it-robo!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.090
Darling...

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.360
Yeah, thanks to the princess and her servants.

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:51.140
<i>I'll do it.</i>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.600
<i>I'll fight to the end.</i>

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.280
<i>Right, Al?</i>

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:12.300
Now then, I guess its my turn.

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:56.530
Demonbane,

00:22:56.530 --> 00:22:58.340
if you're cold steel,

00:22:58.340 --> 00:23:00.240
then I'll share my blood with you.

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:02.030
So give me a sword,

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:04.090
give me steel that will never break!

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:07.550
Next time: Metallic Warcry.

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:10.100
The demon-slaying sword has not yet broken!
